{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019ARRZWRSFG5qoE7jKwpA6q","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contrastive_entrain_calib — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-18 11:03 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP kickoff: framing + plan 完成, Dream 启动, 进入 research 阶段\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nDirection-Contrastive GRPO (DC-GRPO)：用 policy model 自身激活空间中 sycophancy 方向性分解作为 GRPO reward 信号，使模型在多轮对话中抵抗 sycophantic capitulation 同时保留 genuine belief revision。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\n- **主目标**: EACL 2027 via ARR August 2026（DDL: Aug 3, 2026，距今 ~11 周）\\\\n- **冲刺目标**: ICLR 2027（abstract ~Sep 2026）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- 阶段: **Research（post-MVP kickoff）**\\\\n- MVP: ✅ 通过（D007, 2026-05-18）\\\\n  - d_syc 捕获超越风格的认知信号（v2.1 Layer 0=random, L16-19 emergence, CV AUROC=0.826）\\\\n  - 三项 Go/No-Go 全部通过（AUROC=0.9985, Δlayer0=0.31, LoRA delta=0.0044）\\\\n- paper_framing.md: ✅ 已写（3 Core Claims）\\\\n- experiment_plan.yaml: ✅ 已写（13 experiments, P0-P2）\\\\n- Dream: ⏳ dream_20260518T110318 运行中（full review mode）\\\\n- GPU 已用: ~14h / 200h\\\\n- 服务器: westd-29046（RTX PRO 6000 × 2, cuda:0-1）\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims（详见 paper_framing.md）\\\\n1. **Directional discriminability**: d_syc 在中层涌现，捕获认知信号\\\\n2. **DC-GRPO effectiveness**: 打破 sycophancy-revision double-bind\\\\n3. **Representation-level advantage**: R1 检测 behavioral reward 漏掉的 masked sycophancy\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n| 类别 | 预估 GPU-hr | 备注 |\\\\n|------|-------------|------|\\\\n| MVP (已用) | 14 | 完成 |\\\\n| P0 mandatory | 128 | exp-001~006 |\\\\n| P1 important | 23 | exp-007~010 |\\\\n| P2 optional | 35 | exp-011~013 |\\\\n| Buffer | ~20 | |\\\\n| **总计** | **~186 / 200** | P2 视预算弹性裁剪 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 完成，按审稿反馈调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] exp-001: 扩展 v2.1 校准数据至 200 pairs（含 mixed evidence_strength）\\\\n- [ ] 搭